Third-Party Data Notice

The files in this directory are Pyspectral reference data downloaded from Zenodo:

- Relative spectral response data: https://zenodo.org/records/14008148
- Atmospheric correction lookup tables: https://zenodo.org/records/1288441

Zenodo is the hosting and archival service for these files. Copyright and other
rights remain with the original data authors and are governed by the license
published with the corresponding Zenodo records. This copy is included solely
to make the MTG FCI true-color processing image reproducible without requiring
a network download during Docker builds.
